00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.800
Open My Heart!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:12.430
This is...

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.110
me?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.820
Now, think of a name for yourshelf!

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.450
A name?

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:29.550
I...

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:31.700
I want...

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.000
Yeah! I'd love to be named...

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.000
for that glorious Sun!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.600
Itsuki really was...

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.430
...a Precure, after all!

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:47.140
The third Precure is born!

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:48.770
A third?!

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:51.280
That golden Precure is just an eyesore!

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.420
Go get her!

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:54.100
Chaaaaaaaair!

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:24.420
She's strong...

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.510
Chaaaaaaaair!

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:44.170
Big brother,

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:48.950
I shall bring the light back into your heart.

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:52.810
And I pray I can be like the Sun,

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:56.190
so that I become the light that
 watches over everyone's hearts!

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:58.920
My name is...

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:03.110
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.380
Cure Sunshine!

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:09.960
{ED}

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:36.200
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:39.160
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:42.290
