00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:12.110
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:15.160
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.700
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:20.950
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:23.960
So don't sulk

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.880
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:30.340
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:33.550
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.430
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:39.930
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:45.530
<i>Let me introduce myself properly! I'm Cure Sunshine!</i>

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:46.400
<i>Nice to meet you!</i>

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:47.900
<i>She seems really dependable!</i>

00:23:47.900 --> 00:23:51.280
<i>The three of us are as unbreakable as three arrows together! The Desert Apostles stand no chance!{OBSCURE MYTHOLOGICAL REFERENCE}</i>

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:53.280
<i>What's wrong, Potpourri?!</i>

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.910
<i>The Great Heart Tree is in sherious danger!</i>

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:57.690
<i>That figure looks like...</i>

00:23:57.690 --> 00:23:59.160
<i>Speak of the devil!</i>

00:23:59.440 --> 00:24:01.130
<i>Dark Precure?!</i>

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:03.330
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:06.590
Crisis at the Great Heart Tree<i>!</i>

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:06.590
Crisis at the Great Heart Tree<i>!</i>

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:09.030
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
